Return `false` from the `_.transform` iteratee to stop iteration early:

```js
const result = _.transform([1, 2, 3, 4, 5], (acc, value) => {
  if (value > 3) {
    return false; // stops iteration
  }

  acc.push(value * 2);
}, []);

// => [2, 4, 6]
```

The callback receives `(accumulator, value, key, object)`.
